  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco's oxfords offer a sleek, professional appearance without sacrificing comfort and are built to last. These work oxfords are perfect for active-duty personnel, public safety, everyday wear, and more.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "2436",
  "description": "<p>Rothco's oxfords offer a sleek, professional appearance without sacrificing comfort, and are built to last. These work oxfords are perfect for active-duty personnel, public safety, everyday wear, and more.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Hi-Gloss Mirror Shine:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Get work done in style with these feather-light high-gloss oxfords! These dress shoes feature an easy-to-care-for, inspection-ready mirror finish that looks great on the job.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>24-7 Comfort:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Crush those all-day-long missions without any worries with breathable air-mesh lining that provides optimal cooling airflow, and removable comfort cushion insoles that allow you to customize your comfort. The cushioned sole helps reduce stress and fatigue, giving you the freedom to wear these hi-gloss work shoes all day long.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Impenetrable Work Sole:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>These stylish oxfords also feature a sole that consists of an oil resistant polyurethane coating for enhanced traction, and steel shanks with additional arch support for long days on your feet. The rugged lug tread pattern provides added grip and cushioning.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Ultimate Durability:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>With fully stitched soles and a classic goodyear welt that improves overall longevity, these professional work shoes are strong, resilient, and robust. They&rsquo;ll last for years, and are ready to conquer life one step at a time!</li>\n</ul>",
